OL,3,GNEWSAHealth bodies back Nesbitt
OL,4,Afollowing resignation
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials in the health service have
OL,7,Fshown their support for Mike Nesbitt,
OL,8,Fsaying he  "offered strong political
OL,9,Fleadership" and "listened to clinical
OL,10,Fleaders," after his resignation as
OL,11,Fhealth minister amid a row with the UUP
OL,12,Fleader Jon Burrows.
OL,14,FThe decision comes following a clash
OL,15,Fover withdrawing emergency general
OL,16,Fsurgery services from Causeway Hospital
OL,17,Fand moving them to Antrim.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
