OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHealth bodies back Nesbitt
OL,4,Afollowing resignation
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast week Burrows, who is a North
OL,7,FAntrim MLA, told a town hall meeting
OL,8,Fthat he did not support emergency
OL,9,Fgeneral surgery (EGS) being removed
OL,10,Ffrom the hospital.
OL,12,FA Northern Trust spokesperson said the
OL,13,Fcurrent model of providing emergency
OL,14,Fgeneral surgery across two acute sites
OL,15,Fis becoming "increasingly
OL,16,Funsustainable".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
